{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡瘋傳一段港鐵車廂打鬥影片。影片顯示，港鐵港島綫列車內有兩名男乘客突發激烈的肢體衝突，兩人由車廂中央一路推撞至座位附近。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-10h43m02s299.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026qQ4UycP8Zm1790565401.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-10h43m02s299.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">過程中，一名身穿灰衫的男子將Cap帽男壓制在座位上，更直接用雙手緊叉對方的頸部，嚇得附近乘客即時四散躲避。事發時，灰衫男緊緊叉住Cap帽男不放，並不斷大聲喝道：「係你郁我先㗎，你唔好郁。」期間有乘客疑按下緊急通話器向車長通報「呢一卡有人打交」求助。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-10h43m11s448.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026tiZiq63L6g1790565412.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-10h43m11s448.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">雙方僵持不下之際，現場有一男一女乘客勇於上前勸架，兩名打鬥男子才順利分開。當時Cap帽男重新戴好口罩後一度企圖還手，幸得其他乘客及時阻止並勸阻「唔好打喇」，而灰衫男則依然在旁重複辯解「你郁我先㗎」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-10h43m30s159.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026OlACO6ucRu1790565419.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-10h43m30s159.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T03:38:57.803356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}